# Build outputs — never copy host artifacts into the image (stale RID, wrong OS)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/

# VCS / IDE / CI
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Docker's own files
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
compose*.yaml

# Local-only config and secrets
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/*.pfx

# Docs and scratch — not needed to build
docs/
*.md

# OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
